{"title":"Classic Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClassic Artificial Christmas Trees for a Timeless Holiday Look\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClassic artificial Christmas trees from Carol's Christmas Conifers offer a timeless and traditional look to your holiday décor. Featuring full silhouettes and rich green foliage, these trees offer a familiar Christmas tree shape that’s easy to decorate and style year after year.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur collection includes a variety of classic designs, from full, lush trees to space-saving pencil and slim silhouettes. Whether you prefer a pre-lit tree for added convenience or an unlit option for complete customization, each tree is crafted for durability and long-lasting use.\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection of classic artificial Christmas trees to find the perfect centerpiece for your home this holiday season.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is a classic Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur classic trees are traditional artificial trees made with PVC classic tips and a full, uniform shape. Designed for a clean and consistent appearance, these trees provide a structured shape that makes decorating simple and effortless.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eCarol's Christmas Conifers classic artificial Christmas trees offer a timeless appearance at a more accessible price point. Their structured design and familiar silhouette create a nostalgic holiday feel, while providing a durable and dependable option for decorating year after year. For those looking for a more lifelike appearance, explore our \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/realistic-trees\" title=\"Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003erealistic artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e or \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/premium-trees\" title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003epremium artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e for enhanced realism.\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a classic artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClassic artificial Christmas trees are a popular choice for their traditional look and ease of decorating. Their full, structured branches provide a reliable foundation for ornaments, garlands, and lights, making it easy to create a balanced and polished holiday display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eMade with PVC classic tips, these trees offer great value while maintaining durability and long-term performance. Their classic design makes them a reliable and easy-to-decorate choice for any home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat sizes do classic artificial Christmas trees come in?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eCarol's Christmas Conifers offers classic artificial Christmas trees in a variety of heights to suit different spaces, typically ranging from 6 to 10 feet. Our collection includes both full and slim options to complement your holiday vision.\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat lighting options are available on classic artificial Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eCarol's Christmas Conifers pre-lit classic Christmas trees feature micro warm white LED lights professionally strung throughout each branch for a balanced and polished look. Many styles include multiple lighting functions, allowing you to switch between effects such as steady on, twinkling, and fading.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur integrated Power Pole system allows each section of the tree to connect automatically through the center pole, streamlining the setup process. Once assembled, simply plug in the base and your tree lights up instantly. No additional cords, no complicated connections. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eRemote settings may include Steady On, Sequential, In Waves, Slo-Glo, Chasing\/Flash, Slow Fade, Twinkle, and Combination modes, along with a built-in timer and dimmer for added convenience.\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClassic vs. Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees: What’s the difference?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClassic artificial Christmas trees are a strong choice for those looking for a traditional holiday centerpiece at a more accessible price point. Made with PVC classic tips, they feature a full, uniform shape that’s ideal for decorating with \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eornaments\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbon\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eribbon\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, and decorative garland. Their structured design and timeless silhouette offer a nostalgic look that works well in a variety of spaces, including living rooms, offices, and secondary areas throughout the home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/realistic-trees\" title=\"Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eRealistic artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e are designed to closely replicate the look and feel of a natural evergreen. With advanced PE foliage, color variation, and three-dimensional needle detail, these trees provide a more lifelike appearance and are often chosen as a statement centerpiece.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eBoth styles offer the same convenience, durability, and easy setup that make artificial trees a popular choice. The decision ultimately comes down to preference, whether you prioritize a classic, decorative look or a more natural, true-to-life appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you prefer a traditional holiday look or a dependable, easy-to-decorate tree, classic artificial Christmas trees offer timeless style and long-lasting value. Explore our collection to find a classic Christmas tree that fits your home and holiday traditions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"9-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642896576576,"sku":"PF-T9-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_4d66d600-8734-493e-9b99-6279743376a5.jpg?v=1714675446"},{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896707648,"sku":"PF-T10-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d_1.jpg?v=1761241980"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642909257792,"sku":"YF-T7.5-U","price":279.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-10.jpg?v=1718158754"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642909388864,"sku":"YF-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Yorkshire-Fir-v1_04242c5f-9b81-4149-ad07-5298525c13ae.png?v=1722014825"},{"product_id":"9-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 850 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642909683776,"sku":"YF-T9-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Yorkshire-Fir-v1_23ae7381-9bff-4ab6-bc4e-03772aa06a76.png?v=1722014827"},{"product_id":"7-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-tree-unlit","title":"7' Tribeca Blue Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642912370752,"sku":"TBS-T7-U","price":259.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],